er_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"> This PR resolves the resize issue in fullscreen mode but also disables panning in windowed mode, which previously pushed the window upward to make space for the keyboard. While this isn't noticeable on smartphones, it would be on tablets.\r\n\r\nI tested it on my tablet (Samsung Tab S7 - Android 13), this PR would be a regression for me.\r\n\r\n<details><summary>Test / Video</summary>\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e79382fa-78ea-4495-ad6b-624eaaa6e564\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nAlso because `EmbeddedGodotGame` is no longer fully maximized.\r\nOr rather, I think the bar should not be transparent so that the editor behind the window is not visible.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"809\" height=\"62\" alt=\"Bildschirmfoto 2025-10-28 um 13 31 51\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1ad4220e-d015-492a-9d94-15fc72513a51\" />","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104278#pullrequestreview-3388552215","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104278","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104278#pullrequestreview-3388552215"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104278"}},"submitted_at":"2025-10-28T12:34:09Z","commit_id":"cd638cec5367d70a5f537e80a9495dbc2e862372"},{"id":3388759132,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7J_Fxc","user":{"login":"Alex